 Replacement Powder">Meal Replacement Powder</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can serve as one of the main ingredients in meal replacement powders">Potato flakes can serve as one of the main ingredients in meal replacement powders</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="Research shows that potato-based meal replacement powders have good solubility and nutritional protein">Research shows that potato-based meal replacement powders have good solubility and nutritional protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="making them suitable as complementary food for infants or daily dietary supplements for adults">making them suitable as complementary food for infants or daily dietary supplements for adults</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="this meal replacement powder is characterized by low energy">this meal replacement powder is characterized by low energy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="high protein">high protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="and high dietary fiber">and high dietary fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="meeting essential nutrient requirements and helping to regulate gut microbiota">meeting essential nutrient requirements and helping to regulate gut microbiota</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Bread and Puff Snacks">Bread and Puff Snacks</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can be used to make bread and other puff snacks">Potato flakes can be used to make bread and other puff snacks</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="Due to their low fat and low sugar characteristics">Due to their low fat and low sugar characteristics</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes are very suitable for these products">potato flakes are very suitable for these products</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="Noodles and Dried Noodles">Noodles and Dried Noodles</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can be mixed with wheat flour to make soft and delicate noodles and dried noodles">Potato flakes can be mixed with wheat flour to make soft and delicate noodles and dried noodles</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="These noodles not only retain the vitamins">These noodles not only retain the vitamins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="minerals">minerals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="and amino acids found in potatoes but also improve the texture and nutritional profile of the food">and amino acids found in potatoes but also improve the texture and nutritional profile of the food</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="Tangyuan and Other Staple Foods">Tangyuan and Other Staple Foods</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can also be used to make staple food products like tangyuan">Potato flakes can also be used to make staple food products like tangyuan</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="by adding glutinous rice flour and corn starch">by adding glutinous rice flour and corn starch</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="one can produce visually appealing and flavorful potato tangyuan">one can produce visually appealing and flavorful potato tangyuan</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Steamed Breads and Other Flour Products">Steamed Breads and Other Flour Products</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can be used to make steamed breads and other flour products">Potato flakes can be used to make steamed breads and other flour products</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Although some issues may arise during production">Although some issues may arise during production</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="such as high energy consumption and nutrient loss">such as high energy consumption and nutrient loss</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="these can be effectively improved through optimized formulas and processes">these can be effectively improved through optimized formulas and processes</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Other Functional Foods">Other Functional Foods</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can also be used to produce functional foods">Potato flakes can also be used to produce functional foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="such as yogurt and beverages">such as yogurt and beverages</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="These products not only retain the nutritional value of potatoes but also add value to the products">These products not only retain the nutritional value of potatoes but also add value to the products</span>.</li></ul><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="Due to their rich nutritional content and good processing performance">Due to their rich nutritional content and good processing performance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes can be widely used in the production of various meal-replacement foods">potato flakes can be widely used in the production of various meal-replacement foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="including meal-replacement powders">including meal-replacement powders</span>, パン, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="puff snacks">puff snacks</span>, 麺, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="tangyuan">tangyuan</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="steamed bread">steamed bread</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="and other functional foods">and other functional foods</span>.</p><p><img src="/images/butter-milk-mashed-potatoes-300x243.png" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-513" alt="mashed potato flakes" width="485" height="393" title="ポテトフレークは食事の代替品ですかl Reよくある質問 Good to Know 5" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Are_the_Advantages_of_Potato_Flakes_as_a_Meal_Replacement"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="What Are the Advantages of Potato Flakes as a Meal Replacement">What Are the Advantages of Potato Flakes as a Meal Replacement</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="Many people may wonder why">Many people may wonder why</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="with so many meal replacement products on the market">with so many meal replacement products on the market</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="we should choose potato flakes">we should choose potato flakes</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="What advantages do they offer">What advantages do they offer</span>? <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="Here are the benefits that I believe will convince you">Here are the benefits that I believe will convince you</span>:</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="The advantages of potato flakes as a meal replacement powder mainly include the following aspects">The advantages of potato flakes as a meal replacement powder mainly include the following aspects</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="High Nutritional Value">High Nutritional Value</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are rich in protein">Potato flakes are rich in protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="amino acids">amino acids</span>, そしてミネラル, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="providing a high nutritional value">providing a high nutritional value</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="Studies show that the average protein content in different potato varieties is">Studies show that the average protein content in different potato varieties is</span> 9.81 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="g/100 g">g/100 g</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="with a total amino acid content averaging">with a total amino acid content averaging</span> 75.70 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="mg/100 g">mg/100 g</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes are abundant in vitamins B1">potato flakes are abundant in vitamins B1</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="B2">B2</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="and others">and others</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Low Calorie and Low Fat">Low Calorie and Low Fat</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are low in fat">Potato flakes are low in fat</span>, 砂糖, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="and calories">and calories</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="giving them a significant advantage for weight control and healthy eating">giving them a significant advantage for weight control and healthy eating</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="Compared to other grains">Compared to other grains</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes have lower fat content">potato flakes have lower fat content</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="which can aid in weight loss and lower blood lipids">which can aid in weight loss and lower blood lipids</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="Good Water and Oil Retention">Good Water and Oil Retention</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes have a high water and oil retention capacity">Potato flakes have a high water and oil retention capacity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="allowing them to better maintain product texture and flavor during processing">allowing them to better maintain product texture and flavor during processing</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="when making noodles">when making noodles</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="adding potato flakes can improve the cooking characteristics and sensory quality of the dough">adding potato flakes can improve the cooking characteristics and sensory quality of the dough</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="Long Shelf Life">Long Shelf Life</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can be stored at room temperature for over">Potato flakes can be stored at room temperature for over</span> 15 年, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="offering a long shelf life">offering a long shelf life</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="and making them an ideal food reserve">and making them an ideal food reserve</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="Good Processing Performance">Good Processing Performance</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes can be made into various convenience foods">Potato flakes can be made into various convenience foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="such as breakfast porridge">such as breakfast porridge</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="meat rolls">meat rolls</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="and biscuits">and biscuits</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="through scientific formulation and optimized processes">through scientific formulation and optimized processes</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="pre-treatments like steaming can improve their solubility and expansion">pre-treatments like steaming can improve their solubility and expansion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="enhancing processing performance">enhancing processing performance</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="Supports Gut Health">Supports Gut Health</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="The resistant starch in potato flakes helps control obesity">The resistant starch in potato flakes helps control obesity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="improve metabolic syndrome">improve metabolic syndrome</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="and maintain a balanced gut microbiota">and maintain a balanced gut microbiota</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="promoting the growth of beneficial bacteria">promoting the growth of beneficial bacteria</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="Cost-Effective">Cost-Effective</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="While potato flakes may be relatively more expensive than traditional staples like wheat and corn">While potato flakes may be relatively more expensive than traditional staples like wheat and corn</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="their richer nutritional profile makes them a viable alternative as a meal replacement">their richer nutritional profile makes them a viable alternative as a meal replacement</span>.</li></ul><p>ポテトフレーク, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="with their high nutritional value">with their high nutritional value</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="low calories">low calories</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="good water and oil retention">good water and oil retention</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="long shelf life">long shelf life</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="excellent processing performance">excellent processing performance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="and benefits for gut health">and benefits for gut health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="represent an ideal meal replacement food">represent an ideal meal replacement food</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_Much_Potato_Flakes_Food_Is_Suitable_for_Daily_Consumption"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_145" data-source="" data-orig="How Much Potato Flakes Food Is Suitable for Daily Consumption">How Much Potato Flakes Food Is Suitable for Daily Consumption</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="From a nutritional and health perspective">From a nutritional and health perspective</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes can be part of the main diet">potato flakes can be part of the main diet</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="and consuming them in moderation is beneficial">and consuming them in moderation is beneficial</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="studies indicate that incorporating around">studies indicate that incorporating around</span> 30% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes into staple foods">potato flakes into staple foods</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="like steamed buns or noodles">like steamed buns or noodles</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="does not negatively impact the nutrition and health of young individuals">does not negatively impact the nutrition and health of young individuals</span>.</p><p>しかし, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="it’s important to note that the intake of potato flakes should be adjusted based on individual health status">it’s important to note that the intake of potato flakes should be adjusted based on individual health status</span>, 栄養ニーズ, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="and lifestyle habits">and lifestyle habits</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="For people with specific health requirements">For people with specific health requirements</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="such as those with diabetes or obesity">such as those with diabetes or obesity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="more careful control over potato flakes intake may be necessary">more careful control over potato flakes intake may be necessary</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_158" data-source="" data-orig="the consumption of potato flakes should be considered when paired with other foods to ensure balanced nutrition">the consumption of potato flakes should be considered when paired with other foods to ensure balanced nutrition</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_159" data-source="" data-orig="While there is no specific daily recommended intake">While there is no specific daily recommended intake</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_160" data-source="" data-orig="moderate consumption of potato flakes is beneficial for health">moderate consumption of potato flakes is beneficial for health</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_161" data-source="" data-orig="It is advised to adjust the intake of potato flakes based on personal conditions and nutritional needs">It is advised to adjust the intake of potato flakes based on personal conditions and nutritional needs</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_162" data-source="" data-orig="while also considering their combination with other foods to achieve nutritional balance">while also considering their combination with other foods to achieve nutritional balance</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Properly_Use_Potato_Flakes_to_Make_Meal_Replacement_Products"></span><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_163" data-source="" data-orig="How to Properly Use Potato Flakes to Make Meal Replacement Products">How to Properly Use Potato Flakes to Make Meal Replacement Products</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_164" data-source="" data-orig="Proper use of potato flakes to create meal replacement products involves several aspects">Proper use of potato flakes to create meal replacement products involves several aspects</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_165" data-source="" data-orig="including raw material selection">including raw material selection</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_166" data-source="" data-orig="pre-treatment">pre-treatment</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="recipe design">recipe design</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="and processing techniques">and processing techniques</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="Here’s a detailed guide based on the information I found">Here’s a detailed guide based on the information I found</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="Raw Material Selection and Pre-Treatment">Raw Material Selection and Pre-Treatment</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="Choose fresh potatoes as the raw material and process them through washing">Choose fresh potatoes as the raw material and process them through washing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="peeling">peeling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="cutting">cutting</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="steaming">steaming</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="and crushing to create potato flakes">and crushing to create potato flakes</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="Common-pressure steaming can improve the solubility">Common-pressure steaming can improve the solubility</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="expansion">expansion</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="and slowly digestible starch">and slowly digestible starch</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="SDS">SDS</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="content of potato flakes">content of potato flakes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="enhancing the dissolution properties and nutritional value of the meal replacement powder">enhancing the dissolution properties and nutritional value of the meal replacement powder</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="Recipe Design">Recipe Design</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="Design appropriate recipes based on different nutritional needs and taste preferences">Design appropriate recipes based on different nutritional needs and taste preferences</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="a low glycemic index">a low glycemic index</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="GI">GI</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="potato meal replacement powder recipe could include">potato meal replacement powder recipe could include</span> 45% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="potato flakes with high resistant starch">potato flakes with high resistant starch</span>, 25% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="cooked rice flour">cooked rice flour</span>, そして 5% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="sesame powder">sesame powder</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="Another recipe could consist of 65%–70% potato flakes">Another recipe could consist of 65%–70% potato flakes</span>, 15%<span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="–20% millet">–20% millet</span>, 5%<span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="–10% black millet flour">–10% black millet flour</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="and 0.05%–0.1% king oyster mushroom powder">and 0.05%–0.1% king oyster mushroom powder</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="Processing Techniques">Processing Techniques</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="During processing">During processing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="pay attention to factors such as the amount of potato flakes">pay attention to factors such as the amount of potato flakes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="water">water</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="carrageenan">carrageenan</span>, 塩, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="and cooking time to ensure product quality">and cooking time to ensure product quality</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="the optimal formulation for potato flakes baked goods could include">the optimal formulation for potato flakes baked goods could include</span> 20% ポテトフレーク, 68% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="water">water</span>, 0.8% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="yeast">yeast</span>, そして 6% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="granulated sugar">granulated sugar</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="Nutritional and Sensory Evaluation">Nutritional and Sensory Evaluation</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="In recipe design and processing">In recipe design and processing</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="consider both the nutritional value and sensory quality of the meal replacement products">consider both the nutritional value and sensory quality of the meal replacement products</span>. 例えば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="protein nutritional analysis of certain formulations shows that their EAA/TAA and EAA/NAA values are close to the ideal protein standards set by FAO/WHO">protein nutritional analysis of certain formulations shows that their EAA/TAA and EAA/NAA values are close to the ideal protein standards set by FAO/WHO</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="ensure good taste and flavor through sensory scoring and texture evaluation">ensure good taste and flavor through sensory scoring and texture evaluation</span>.</li></ul><p>要約すれば, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="properly using potato flakes to make meal replacement products requires a comprehensive consideration of raw material selection">properly using potato flakes to make meal replacement products requires a comprehensive consideration of raw material selection</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="pre-treatment">pre-treatment</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="recipe design">recipe design</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="and processing techniques">and processing techniques</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="ensuring that the products have good nutritional value while meeting consumers">ensuring that the products have good nutritional value while meeting consumers</span>&#8217; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_214" data-source="" data-orig="taste and sensory quality needs">taste and sensory quality needs</span>.</p><blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="qlQQ5zcYRx"><p><a href="/ja/potato-deep-processing/">ジャガイモの深部加工の完全ガイド</a></p></blockquote><p><iframe data-lazyloaded="1" src="about:blank" class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="&#8220;ジャガイモの深部加工の完全ガイド&#8221; &#8212; 中国北部のジャガイモ生産専門家" data-litespeed-src="/ja/potato-deep-processing/embed/#?secret=bu7tAOFTmS#?secret=qlQQ5zcYRx" data-secret="qlQQ5zcYRx" width="600" height="338" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p><blockquote class="wp-embedded-content" data-secret="xXflYYeNcl"><p><a href="/ja/potato-flakes-and-granules/">ポテトフレークおよび顆粒: プロパティ, 用途, と違い</a></p></blockquote><p><iframe data-lazyloaded="1" src="about:blank" class="wp-embedded-content" sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" style="position: absolute; visibility: hidden;" title="&#8220;ポテトフレークおよび顆粒: プロパティ, 用途, と違い&#8221; &#8212; 中国北部のジャガイモ生産専門家" data-litespeed-src="/ja/potato-flakes-and-granules/embed/#?secret=oZSnKpK8Ea#?secret=xXflYYeNcl" data-secret="xXflYYeNcl" width="600" height="338" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>`} />
